adows, retracing the trail back to Lohajung. Reach by afternoon and relax at the guesthouse, celebrating the successful completion of the trek with an overnight stay.", "distance": "13 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Lohajung to Dehradun", "description": "Day 6: Lohajung to Dehradun (Drive: 250 km | 9\u201310 hrs) After breakfast, depart from Lohajung and drive back to Dehradun through scenic Himalayan roads, river valleys, and traditional villages, concluding the Brahmtal Trek with unforgettable mountain memories.", "distance": "250 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Kathgodam", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
