        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Rishikesh to Chopta", "description": "Day 01: Rishikesh to Chopta (8,790 ft) \u2013 Drive 210 km | 7\u20138 hrs. Depart early from Rishikesh and enjoy a scenic drive through Devprayag, Rudraprayag, and Ukhimath before reaching the beautiful meadow region of Chopta. Check into your campsite or hotel, relax in the evening, and enjoy dinner with an overnight stay.", "distance": "210 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Chopta", "description": "Day 02: Chopta (8,790 ft) \u2192 Tungnath (12,073 ft) \u2192 Chandrashila (13,123 ft) \u2192 Chopta \u2013 Trek 10 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Begin an early morning trek to the sacred Tungnath Temple, the world''s highest Shiva temple, and continue towards Chandrashila Peak, offering magnificent 360\u00b0 views of Nanda Devi, Chaukhamba, Trishul, and Kedarnath peaks. Descend back to Chopta for dinner and overnight stay.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Chopta to Rishikesh", "description": "Day 03: Chopta to Rishikesh \u2013 Drive 210 km | 7\u20138 hrs. After breakfast, drive back through the picturesque Himalayan valleys and river confluences, reaching Rishikesh by evening with unforgettable memories of the trek.", "distance": "210 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Rishikesh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
