Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Valley of Flowers Trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Rishikesh to Govindghat", "description": "Day 01: Rishikesh to Govindghat (5,971 ft) \u2013 Drive 275 km | 9\u201310 hrs. Travel through the scenic confluences of Devprayag, Rudraprayag, Karnaprayag, and Joshimath before reaching Govindghat for an overnight stay at a guest house or hotel.", "distance": "275 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Govindghat", "description": "Day 02: Govindghat (5,971 ft) to Ghangaria (10,003 ft) \u2013 Trek 13 km | 6\u20137 hrs. Follow the beautiful trail along the Lakshman Ganga River, passing waterfalls and lush forests before arriving at Ghangaria, the base camp for both Valley of Flowers and Hemkund Sahib.", "distance": "13 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Ghangaria", "description": "Day 03: Ghangaria (10,003 ft) to Valley of Flowers (11,500\u201312,000 ft) and back \u2013 Trek 10 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Explore the UNESCO-listed Valley of Flowers, famous for its vibrant alpine blooms, rare Himalayan flora, waterfalls, and breathtaking mountain scenery before returning to Ghangaria.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Ghangaria", "description": "Day 04: Ghangaria (10,003 ft) to Hemkund Sahib (14,107 ft) and back \u2013 Trek 12 km | 6\u20137 hrs. Ascend to the sacred Hemkund Sahib Gurudwara, nestled beside a pristine glacial lake and surrounded by snow-clad peaks, then descend back to Ghangaria for an overnight stay.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Ghangaria", "description": "Day 05: Ghangaria (10,003 ft) to Govindghat (5,971 ft) \u2013 Trek 13 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Descend through picturesque valleys, forests, and streams back to Govindghat and enjoy a comfortable overnight stay.", "distance": "13 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Govindghat to Rishikesh", "description": "Day 06: Govindghat to Rishikesh \u2013 Drive 275 km | 9\u201310 hrs. Drive back through the Garhwal Himalayas, carrying unforgettable memories of colorful meadows, sacred landscapes, and stunning Himalayan vistas.", "distance": "275 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Rishikesh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
