Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Bali Pass Trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Dehradun to Sankri", "description": "Day 01: Dehradun to Sankri (6,562 ft) \u2013 Drive 200 km | 8\u20139 hrs. Depart early from Dehradun and enjoy a scenic drive through Mussoorie, Purola, and Mori valleys before reaching Sankri, a picturesque Himalayan village. Dinner and overnight stay.", "distance": "200 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Sankri to Taluka", "description": "Day 02: Sankri to Taluka (Drive) & Trek to Seema (8,399 ft) \u2013 Trek 12 km | 5\u20136 hrs. After a short drive to Taluka, begin trekking alongside the Supin River through dense forests, wooden bridges, and charming villages before reaching Seema campsite.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Seema", "description": "Day 03: Seema (8,399 ft) to Rainbasera (10,125 ft) \u2013 Trek 10 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Trek through beautiful alpine forests and open meadows with stunning Himalayan views before arriving at the peaceful Rainbasera campsite.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Rainbasera", "description": "Day 04: Rainbasera (10,125 ft) to Ruinsara Tal (11,696 ft) \u2013 Trek 8 km | 4\u20135 hrs. Continue towards the breathtaking Ruinsara Tal, a pristine high-altitude lake surrounded by snow-covered peaks, offering spectacular sunset views.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Ruinsara Tal", "description": "Day 05: Ruinsara Tal (11,696 ft) to Odari (13,150 ft) \u2013 Trek 6 km | 4\u20135 hrs. Ascend gradually through rocky terrain and alpine landscapes to reach Odari, a beautiful campsite known for its glacier views and dramatic mountain setting.", "distance": "6 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Odari", "description": "Day 06: Odari (13,150 ft) to Bali Pass Base Camp (15,348 ft) \u2013 Trek 5 km | 4\u20135 hrs. A short yet steep climb leads to Bali Pass Base Camp, where trekkers are rewarded with magnificent views of Swargarohini and Bandarpoonch peaks.", "distance": "5 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Bali Pass Base Camp", "description": "Day 07: Bali Pass Base Camp (15,348 ft) to Bali Pass (16,240 ft) and Lower Dhamni (11,811 ft) \u2013 Trek 15 km | 9\u201310 hrs. The most adventurous day of the trek includes an early morning summit push to Bali Pass, followed by a thrilling descent to Lower Dhamni campsite.", "distance": "15 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Day 8", "description": "Day 08: Lower Dhamni to Janki Chatti via Yamunotri and Drive to Dehradun \u2013 Trek 8 km | 4\u20135 hrs & Drive 180 km | 6\u20137 hrs. Descend towards the sacred Yamunotri Temple, seek blessings, and continue to Janki Chatti before driving back to Dehradun.", "distance": "180 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Dehradun Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Dehradun", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
