na Village to reach Badrinath, where you can relax and explore the spiritual surroundings.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Badrinath to Rishikesh", "description": "Day 07: Badrinath to Rishikesh \u2013 Drive 300 km | 10\u201311 hrs. After breakfast, drive back to Rishikesh through the scenic Garhwal Himalayas, concluding an unforgettable journey to one of Uttarakhand''s most sacred high-altitude lakes.", "distance": "300 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Rishikesh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
