38 hrs. Descend through alpine landscapes and beautiful valleys back to Ruing Village for an overnight stay.", "distance": "18 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Ruing Village to Joshimath and Drive to Rishikesh", "description": "Day 07: Ruing Village to Joshimath and Drive to Rishikesh \u2013 Trek 4 km | 2 hrs, Drive 300 km | 10\u201311 hrs. Trek back to Jumma and continue the scenic drive to Rishikesh, concluding an adventurous Himalayan journey.", "distance": "300 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Rishikesh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
