        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Rishikesh to Munsiyari", "description": "Day 01: Rishikesh to Munsiyari (7,200 ft) \u2013 Drive 320 km | 10\u201311 hrs. Begin your journey from Rishikesh and drive through the scenic Kumaon Himalayas to reach the beautiful hill town of Munsiyari, famous for its stunning views of the Panchachuli peaks. Overnight stay at a guest house.", "distance": "320 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Munsiyari", "description": "Day 02: Munsiyari (7,200 ft) to Lilam (6,100 ft) \u2013 Trek 12 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Start the trek along the Gori Ganga River, passing through dense forests, waterfalls, and traditional Himalayan villages before reaching Lilam campsite.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Lilam", "description": "Day 03: Lilam (6,100 ft) to Bugdiar (8,950 ft) \u2013 Trek 14 km | 6\u20137 hrs. Trek through narrow gorges, hanging bridges, and lush valleys while enjoying spectacular mountain scenery on the way to Bugdiar.", "distance": "14 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Bugdiar", "description": "Day 04: Bugdiar (8,950 ft) to Martoli (11,480 ft) \u2013 Trek 11 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Ascend gradually into the Johar Valley, passing ancient settlements and vast alpine landscapes before reaching the historic village of Martoli.", "distance": "11 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Martoli", "description": "Day 05: Martoli (11,480 ft) to Nanda Devi East Base Camp (13,780 ft) and back to Martoli \u2013 Trek 14 km | 7\u20138 hrs. Visit the majestic Nanda Devi East Base Camp, surrounded by towering snow-covered peaks, glaciers, and breathtaking Himalayan vistas before returning to Martoli.", "distance": "14 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Martoli", "description": "Day 06: Martoli (11,480 ft) to Bugdiar (8,950 ft) \u2013 Trek 11 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Descend through scenic valleys and alpine meadows while reliving the unforgettable memories of the base camp