Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Sunderdhunga Trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Rishikesh to Khati Village", "description": "Day 01: Rishikesh to Khati Village (7,280 ft) \u2013 Drive 420 km | 11\u201312 hrs. Travel through the scenic Kumaon Himalayas via Almora, Bageshwar, and Bharadi to reach Khati Village, the last inhabited village on the route. Overnight stay at a guest house or homestay.", "distance": "420 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Khati Village", "description": "Day 02: Khati Village (7,280 ft) to Jaitoli (8,850 ft) \u2013 Trek 10 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Trek through dense forests, wooden bridges, and picturesque mountain trails while following the Sunderdhunga Valley to reach Jaitoli campsite.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Jaitoli", "description": "Day 03: Jaitoli (8,850 ft) to Kathalia (10,660 ft) \u2013 Trek 11 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Ascend gradually through alpine forests and beautiful meadows before reaching Kathalia, a stunning campsite nestled amidst towering Himalayan peaks.", "distance": "11 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Kathalia", "description": "Day 04: Kathalia (10,660 ft) to Maiktoli Base Camp (13,120 ft) and back \u2013 Trek 12 km | 6\u20137 hrs. Explore the upper reaches of the valley and enjoy magnificent views of the Maiktoli Glacier, snow-clad mountains, and pristine alpine landscapes before returning to Kathalia.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Kathalia", "description": "Day 05: Kathalia (10,660 ft) to Sukhram Cave (12,140 ft) and back \u2013 Trek 10 km | 5\u20136 hrs. Visit the famous Sukhram Cave and witness spectacular views of surrounding glaciers, ridges, and the majestic Himalayan wilderness.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Kathalia", "description": "Day 06: Kathalia (10,660 ft) to Jaitoli (8,850 ft) \u2013 Trek 11 km | 4\u20135 hrs. Descend through scenic forests and mountain valleys back to Jaitoli campsite.", "distance": "11 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Jaitoli", "description": "Day 07: Jaitoli (8,850 ft) to Khati Village (7,280 ft) \u2013 Trek 10 km | 4\u20135 hrs. Continue descending through beautiful Himalayan landscapes and traditional villages before reaching Khati.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Khati Village to Rishikesh", "description": "Day 08: Khati Village to Rishikesh \u2013 Drive 420 km | 11\u201312 hrs. Drive back through the picturesque Kumaon region, concluding an unforgettable expedition into the beautiful Sunderdhunga Valley.", "distance": "420 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Pantnagar Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Kathgodam Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Kathgodam", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
