Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Kalindi Khal Trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Dehradun to Gangotri", "description": "Day 1: Dehradun to Gangotri (10,200 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 250 km in 9\u201310 hours via Uttarkashi and Harsil to reach Gangotri. Enjoy beautiful views of the Bhagirathi Valley, pine forests and snow-clad peaks before an overnight stay and expedition briefing.", "distance": "250 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Gangotri to Chirbasa", "description": "Day 2: Gangotri to Chirbasa (11,800 ft) \u2013 Trek around 9 km in 4\u20135 hours along the Bhagirathi River through pine forests and rocky mountain trails. The gradual ascent offers magnificent views of the Gangotri peaks before camping at Chirbasa.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Chirbasa to Bhojbasa", "description": "Day 3: Chirbasa to Bhojbasa (12,450 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 5 km in 3\u20134 hours through wide glacial valleys lined with birch trees and rugged Himalayan terrain. Reach Bhojbasa campsite with spectacular views of the Bhagirathi massif.", "distance": "5 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Bhojbasa to Nandanvan", "description": "Day 4: Bhojbasa to Nandanvan (14,900 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 8 km in 5\u20136 hours crossing the Gangotri Glacier over moraine, ice and boulder sections. Reach Nandanvan, a beautiful meadow situated at the base of the towering Bhagirathi peaks.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Acclimatization at Nandanvan", "description": "Day 5: Acclimatization at Nandanvan (14,900 ft) \u2013 Spend the day acclimatizing with short hikes around the campsite and exploring the surrounding glacier region. Proper acclimatization is essential before venturing into higher altitudes.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Nandanvan to Vasuki Tal", "description": "Day 6: Nandanvan to Vasuki Tal (16,200 ft) \u2013 Trek around 7 km in 5\u20136 hours over glacial terrain and rocky ridges. The trail offers breathtaking views of Mt. Shivling, Mt. Meru and the surrounding Himalayan giants before reaching the pristine Vasuki Tal campsite.", "distance": "7 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Vasuki Tal to Khara Pathar", "description": "Day 7: Vasuki Tal to Khara Pathar (17,100 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 8 km in 6\u20137 hours through moraine fields, snow patches and rugged high-altitude terrain. Reach Khara Pathar, a remote campsite surrounded by dramatic Himalayan landscapes.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Khara Pathar to Rajparav via Kalindi Khal", "description": "Day 8: Khara Pathar to Rajparav via Kalindi Khal (19,520 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 10 km in 10\u201312 hours crossing the mighty Kalindi Khal, the highest point of the expedition. Traverse glaciers, steep snow slopes and technical sections before descending to Rajparav campsite.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 9, "title": "Rajparav to Arwa Tal", "description": "Day 9: Rajparav to Arwa Tal (16,400 ft) \u2013 Descend around 12 km in 6\u20137 hours through glacial valleys, moraine sections and rocky terrain. The route offers stunning views of snow-covered peaks and alpine landscapes.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 10, "title": "Arwa Tal to Ghastoli", "description": "Day 10: Arwa Tal to Ghastoli (12,450 ft) \u2013 Trek approximately 14 km in 6\u20137 hours descending into the upper reaches of the Dhauli Ganga Valley. The landscape gradually transitions into greener alpine surroundings.", "distance": "14 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 11, "title": "Ghastoli to Badrinath", "description": "Day 11: Ghastoli to Badrinath (10,170 ft) \u2013 Cover nearly 18 km in 6\u20137 hours along mountain trails and river valleys before reaching the sacred town of Badrinath. Relax and explore the temple surroundings.", "distance": "18 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 12, "title": "Badrinath to Joshimath", "description": "Day 12: Badrinath to Joshimath (6,150 ft) \u2013 Drive about 45 km in 2 hours through the Alaknanda Valley to Joshimath. Spend the evening resting and enjoying the mountain town atmosphere.", "distance": "45 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 13, "title": "Joshimath to Dehradun", "description": "Day 13: Joshimath to Dehradun \u2013 Drive approximately 290 km in 9\u201310 hours via Rudraprayag, Srinagar and Rishikesh to reach Dehradun, concluding the legendary Kalindi Khal expedition.", "distance": "290 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Dehradun Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Gangotri", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
