Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Kedarnath Yatra stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Haridwar", "description": "Day 1: Haridwar \u2013 Rishikesh \u2013 Sitapur / Sonprayag (6,000 ft) \u2013 Early morning pickup from Haridwar and drive towards Rishikesh, continuing through the scenic confluences of Devprayag, Srinagar, Rudraprayag and Agastyamuni to reach Sitapur or Sonprayag by evening. Cover approximately 220 km in 8\u20139 hours, check into the hotel, relax amidst the Himalayan surroundings and enjoy dinner followed by an overnight stay. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Sitapur / Sonprayag.", "distance": "220 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Sonprayag", "description": "Day 2: Sonprayag \u2013 Gaurikund \u2013 Kedarnath (11,755 ft) \u2013 After an early breakfast, drive to Gaurikund and begin the sacred 18 km trek to Kedarnath Temple, taking around 7\u20139 hours through waterfalls, mountain trails and beautiful valleys. Reach Kedarnath by evening, attend the divine aarti at the temple and soak in the spiritual atmosphere before an overnight stay near the shrine. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Guesthouse / Dharamshala at Kedarnath.", "distance": "18 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Kedarnath", "description": "Day 3: Kedarnath \u2013 Gaurikund \u2013 Sonprayag / Sitapur (6,000 ft) \u2013 Wake up early for morning darshan at Kedarnath Temple and witness the serene Himalayan ambiance before trekking 18 km back to Gaurikund in 5\u20136 hours. Drive back to Sonprayag or Sitapur, check into the hotel, relax after the trek and enjoy dinner before an overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Sitapur / Sonprayag.", "distance": "18 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Sitapur / Sonprayag", "description": "Day 4: Sitapur / Sonprayag \u2013 Rishikesh \u2013 Haridwar \u2013 After breakfast, begin the return journey towards Haridwar via Rishikesh, covering approximately 220 km in 8\u20139 hours through the picturesque Mandakini and Ganga valleys. Arrive at Haridwar by evening with unforgettable memories and divine blessings from the sacred Kedarnath Dham. Meals: Breakfast.", "distance": "220 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Haridwar", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
