        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Haridwar / Dehradun to Joshimath", "description": "Day 1: Haridwar / Dehradun to Joshimath (6,150 ft) \u2013 Depart early morning from Haridwar or Dehradun and embark on a scenic drive of approximately 280\u2013300 km in 9\u201310 hours via Devprayag, Rudraprayag, Karnaprayag and Nandprayag. Witness the spectacular confluences of the Alaknanda River before arriving at Joshimath by evening. Check into the hotel, enjoy dinner and relax for the night. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Joshimath.", "distance": "280\u2013300 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Joshimath to Badrinath", "description": "Day 2: Joshimath to Badrinath (10,279 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive approximately 45 km in 2 hours to the sacred Badrinath Dham. Visit the revered Badrinath Temple, take a holy dip in Tapt Kund and explore nearby attractions such as Brahma Kapal and Charan Paduka. Attend the divine evening Aarti at the temple before dinner and an overnight stay in Badrinath. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Badrinath.", "distance": "45 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Badrinath to Rudraprayag / Srinagar", "description": "Day 3: Badrinath to Rudraprayag / Srinagar (2,920\u20133,000 ft) \u2013 Begin the day with early morning darshan at Badrinath Temple followed by an optional excursion to Mana Village, the last inhabited village near the Indo-Tibetan border. Later, drive approximately 160\u2013180 km in 6\u20137 hours towards Rudraprayag or Srinagar, enjoying magnificent Himalayan landscapes throughout the journey. Dinner and overnight stay at the hotel. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Rudraprayag / Srinagar.", "distance": "160\u2013180 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Rudraprayag / Srinagar to Haridwar / Dehradun", "description": "Day 4: Rudraprayag / Srinagar to Haridwar / Dehradun \u2013 After breakfast, drive back to Haridwar or Dehradun via Devprayag, covering around 160\u2013180 km in 6\u20137 hours. Enjoy beautiful views of the Alaknanda and Ganga valleys before reaching your destination by evening, concluding the pilgrimage with the divine blessings of Lord Badri Vishal. Meals: Breakfast.", "distance": "160\u2013180 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Haridwar", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
