        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Haridwar to Barkot", "description": "Day 1: Haridwar to Barkot (4,000 ft) \u2013 Early morning departure from Haridwar and drive approximately 180 km in 7\u20138 hours via Dehradun, Mussoorie and Kempty Falls to reach Barkot. Enjoy scenic views of the Yamuna Valley, lush forests and Himalayan landscapes before checking into the hotel for dinner and an overnight stay. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Barkot.", "distance": "180 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Barkot", "description": "Day 2: Barkot \u2013 Janki Chatti \u2013 Yamunotri (10,800 ft) \u2013 Barkot \u2013 After breakfast, drive 45 km to Janki Chatti and begin the 6 km trek to the sacred Yamunotri Temple, taking around 3\u20134 hours. Visit Divya Shila, Surya Kund and seek blessings at Yamunotri Dham before trekking back to Janki Chatti and driving to Barkot for dinner and an overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Barkot.", "distance": "6 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Barkot to Gangotri", "description": "Day 3: Barkot to Gangotri (10,200 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 220 km in 8\u20139 hours via Uttarkashi and Harsil to reach Gangotri. En route, witness beautiful valleys, pine forests and the Bhagirathi River. Attend the evening aarti at the sacred Gangotri Temple and enjoy a peaceful overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Gangotri.", "distance": "220 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Gangotri to Uttarkashi", "description": "Day 4: Gangotri to Uttarkashi (3,790 ft) \u2013 After morning darshan at Gangotri Temple, drive approximately 100 km in 4\u20135 hours back to Uttarkashi. Explore the spiritual town, visit local temples if time permits and relax at the hotel after dinner. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Uttarkashi.", "distance": "100 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Uttarkashi to Haridwar", "description": "Day 5: Uttarkashi to Haridwar \u2013 After breakfast, drive approximately 170 km in 6\u20137 hours via Chamba and Rishikesh to reach Haridwar by evening, concluding the sacred Do Dham Yatra with divine blessings and unforgettable memories. Meals: Breakfast.", "distance": "170 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Haridwar", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
