        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Haridwar / Rishikesh to Sonprayag", "description": "Day 1: Haridwar / Rishikesh to Sonprayag (6,000 ft) \u2013 Begin the journey with an early morning drive from Haridwar or Rishikesh towards Sonprayag, covering approximately 220 km in 8\u20139 hours via Devprayag, Srinagar, Rudraprayag and Agastyamuni. Enjoy breathtaking Himalayan landscapes, river confluences and picturesque mountain roads before reaching Sonprayag by evening for hotel check-in, dinner and overnight stay. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Sonprayag.", "distance": "220 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Sonprayag", "description": "Day 2: Sonprayag \u2013 Gaurikund \u2013 Kedarnath (11,755 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive to Gaurikund and commence the sacred 16 km trek to Kedarnath, taking approximately 8\u20139 hours through scenic valleys, waterfalls and Himalayan trails. Arrive at Kedarnath by evening, seek blessings at the revered temple and spend the night in a camp, guesthouse or hotel near the shrine. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Kedarnath.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Kedarnath", "description": "Day 3: Kedarnath \u2013 Sonprayag (6,000 ft) \u2013 Wake up early to attend the divine morning Aarti at Kedarnath Temple and experience the spiritual ambiance of the holy shrine. Later, trek back 16 km to Gaurikund and drive to Sonprayag. Upon arrival, check into the hotel, relax and enjoy dinner followed by an overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Sonprayag.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Sonprayag to Badrinath", "description": "Day 4: Sonprayag to Badrinath (10,279 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive approximately 230 km in 8\u20139 hours via Ukhimath, Chopta, Joshimath and Pandukeshwar to reach the sacred town of Badrinath. Visit the famous Badrinath Temple, attend the evening Aarti and spend the night in a comfortable hotel amidst the majestic Himalayan surroundings. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Badrinath.", "distance": "230 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Badrinath to Haridwar / Rishikesh", "description": "Day 5: Badrinath to Haridwar / Rishikesh \u2013 Begin the return journey after breakfast and drive approximately 320 km in 10\u201311 hours via Joshimath, Karnaprayag, Rudraprayag and Devprayag to reach Haridwar or Rishikesh by evening, concluding the sacred Do Dham pilgrimage with divine blessings and unforgettable memories. Meals: Breakfast.", "distance": "320 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Haridwar", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
