        'Yatra', 'The Char Dham Yatra is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of UTTARKAHSI, Uttrakhand. Rising to an impressive altitude of 11755ft over a duration of 10D/9N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

