Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Char Dham Yatra stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.', 'The Char Dham Yatra is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of UTTARKAHSI, Uttrakhand. Rising to an impressive altitude of 11755ft over a duration of 10D/9N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

Traversing through dense oak, pine, and vibrant rhododendron canopies, travelers experience panoramic vistas of snow-crowned Himalayan peaks, sparkling glacial river valleys, and remote mountain hamlets steeped in centuries-old traditions. The journey commences from Haridwar, taking explorers deep into untamed valleys where cool, changing mountain weather graces the trails. Each step along this route reveals untouched flora, alpine meadows, and timeless folklore cherished by the local indigenous communities.

Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Char Dham Yatra stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Haridwar to Barkot", "description": "Day 1: Haridwar to Barkot (4,000 ft) \u2013 Begin your sacred Char Dham journey with an early morning departure from Haridwar and drive approximately 180 km in 6\u20137 hours via Dehradun, Mussoorie and Kempty Falls to reach Barkot. Enjoy scenic Himalayan landscapes, lush valleys and views of the Yamuna River before checking into the hotel for dinner and an overnight stay. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Barkot.", "distance": "180 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Barkot", "description": "Day 2: Barkot \u2013 Janki Chatti \u2013 Yamunotri Darshan \u2013 Barkot (10,800 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive to Janki Chatti and commence the 6 km trek to the revered Yamunotri Temple. Visit Surya Kund, Divya Shila and seek blessings at the temple before returning to Janki Chatti and driving back to Barkot for dinner and overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Barkot.", "distance": "6 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Barkot to Uttarkashi", "description": "Day 3: Barkot to Uttarkashi (3,790 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 100 km in 4\u20135 hours through picturesque valleys and forested landscapes to reach Uttarkashi. Explore the spiritual town situated on the banks of the Bhagirathi River and relax at the hotel for an overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Uttarkashi.", "distance": "100 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Uttarkashi", "description": "Day 4: Uttarkashi \u2013 Gangotri Darshan \u2013 Uttarkashi (10,200 ft) \u2013 Drive around 100 km in 4 hours each way through Harsil Valley to visit the sacred Gangotri Temple. Attend darshan, explore the temple surroundings and enjoy the serene atmosphere before returning to Uttarkashi for dinner and overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Uttarkashi.", "distance": "100 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Uttarkashi to Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi", "description": "Day 5: Uttarkashi to Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi (6,000 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive approximately 220 km in 8\u20139 hours via Tehri, Srinagar and Rudraprayag to reach Sitapur, Sonprayag or Guptkashi. Check into the hotel, relax and prepare for the Kedarnath trek. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi.", "distance": "220 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi", "description": "Day 6: Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi \u2013 Kedarnath Trek (11,755 ft) \u2013 Early morning drive to Gaurikund followed by the sacred 16\u201318 km trek to Kedarnath Temple. Reach Kedarnath by evening, participate in the divine aarti and spend the night near the temple amidst the majestic Himalayan peaks. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Kedarnath.", "distance": "16\u201318 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Kedarnath", "description": "Day 7: Kedarnath \u2013 Gaurikund \u2013 Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi (6,000 ft) \u2013 Attend the morning darshan at Kedarnath Temple before descending the 16\u201318 km trek back to Gaurikund. Drive to Sitapur, Sonprayag or Guptkashi and enjoy dinner followed by an overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi.", "distance": "16\u201318 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi to Pipalkoti / Joshimath", "description": "Day 8: Sitapur / Sonprayag / Guptkashi to Pipalkoti / Joshimath (4,100\u20136,150 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 210 km in 8\u20139 hours through the Garhwal Himalayas via Chopta, Chamoli and Joshimath to reach Pipalkoti or Joshimath for dinner and overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Pipalkoti / Joshimath.", "distance": "210 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 9, "title": "Pipalkoti / Joshimath", "description": "Day 9: Pipalkoti / Joshimath \u2013 Badrinath Darshan \u2013 Return Stay (10,279 ft) \u2013 Drive around 75 km to Badrinath Dham and visit the sacred temple, Tapt Kund, Brahma Kapal and nearby attractions. Attend darshan before returning to Pipalkoti or Joshimath for dinner and overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Pipalkoti / Joshimath.", "distance": "75 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 10, "title": "Pipalkoti / Joshimath to Haridwar", "description": "Day 10: Pipalkoti / Joshimath to Haridwar \u2013 After breakfast, drive approximately 235 km in 6\u20137 hours via Karnaprayag, Rudraprayag and Devprayag to reach Haridwar by evening, concluding the divine Char Dham Yatra with lifelong memories and blessings.", "distance": "235 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jolly Grant Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Rishikesh Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Haridwar", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
