        'Yatra', 'The Adi Kailash Yatra is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of PITHORAGARH, Uttrakhand. Rising to an impressive altitude of 19940ft over a duration of 8D/7N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

