Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Adi Kailash Yatra stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Kathgodam to Pithoragarh", "description": "Day 1: Kathgodam to Pithoragarh (5,400 ft) \u2013 Arrive at Kathgodam and drive approximately 210 km in 7\u20138 hours through Bhimtal, Almora and scenic Kumaon valleys to reach Pithoragarh. Enjoy breathtaking views of the Himalayan ranges, check into the hotel and relax for an overnight stay. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Pithoragarh.", "distance": "210 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Pithoragarh to Dharchula", "description": "Day 2: Pithoragarh to Dharchula (3,100 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive around 95 km in 4\u20135 hours along the Kali River valley to reach Dharchula, a beautiful border town situated on the Indo-Nepal frontier. Complete permit formalities and spend the evening at leisure. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Dharchula.", "distance": "95 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Dharchula to Gunji", "description": "Day 3: Dharchula to Gunji (10,500 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 70 km in 5\u20136 hours through Tawaghat, Malpa and Budhi while witnessing spectacular mountain scenery, waterfalls and deep gorges. Reach Gunji by evening and acclimatize to the higher altitude. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Gunji.", "distance": "70 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Gunji", "description": "Day 4: Gunji \u2013 Adi Kailash \u2013 Parvati Sarovar \u2013 Gunji (15,500 ft) \u2013 Drive nearly 35 km in 2\u20133 hours to Jolingkong and visit the sacred Adi Kailash peak along with the serene Parvati Sarovar. Spend time soaking in the spiritual atmosphere and stunning Himalayan views before returning to Gunji for an overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Gunji.", "distance": "35 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Gunji", "description": "Day 5: Gunji \u2013 Om Parvat Darshan \u2013 Nabi \u2013 Gunji (14,000 ft) \u2013 Early morning excursion towards Nabidhang for the divine darshan of Om Parvat, where the natural snow formation resembles the sacred symbol \u2018\u0950\u2019. After enjoying the majestic views, return to Gunji for dinner and overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Gunji.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Gunji to Dharchula", "description": "Day 6: Gunji to Dharchula (3,100 ft) \u2013 Drive back approximately 70 km in 5\u20136 hours through the picturesque valleys and rugged Himalayan terrain to reach Dharchula. Spend the evening relaxing and exploring the local market. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Dharchula.", "distance": "70 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Dharchula to Pithoragarh", "description": "Day 7: Dharchula to Pithoragarh (5,400 ft) \u2013 After breakfast, drive around 95 km in 4\u20135 hours to Pithoragarh while enjoying scenic views of the Kumaon Himalayas. Check into the hotel and relax for the final night of the journey. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Pithoragarh.", "distance": "95 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Pithoragarh to Kathgodam", "description": "Day 8: Pithoragarh to Kathgodam \u2013 Depart after breakfast and drive approximately 210 km in 7\u20138 hours back to Kathgodam, concluding the spiritually enriching Adi Kailash Yatra with unforgettable memories and blessings.", "distance": "210 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Pantnagar Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Kathgodam Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Kathgodam", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
        30.7333, 76.7794, '19940ft', '', '',
