        'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb"]'::jsonb,
        'Adventure', 'The Rupin Pass trek is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of SHIMLA, Himachal Pradesh. Rising to an impressive altitude of 15380ft over a duration of 8D/7N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

Traversing through dense oak, pine, and vibrant rhododendron canopies, travelers experience panoramic vistas of snow-crowned Himalayan peaks, sparkling glacial river valleys, and remote mountain hamlets steeped in centuries-old traditions. The journey commences from Dehradun, taking explorers deep into untamed valleys where cold with changing weather graces the trails. Each step along this route reveals untouched flora, alpine meadows, and timeless folklore cherished by the local indigenous communities.

Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Rupin Pass trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.', 'The Rupin Pass trek is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of SHIMLA, Himachal Pradesh. Rising to an impressive altitude of 15380ft over a duration of 8D/7N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

Traversing through dense oak, pine, and vibrant rhododendron canopies, travelers experience panoramic vistas of snow-crowned Himalayan peaks, sparkling glacial river valleys, and remote mountain hamlets steeped in centuries-old traditions. The journey commences from Dehradun, taking explorers deep into untamed valleys where cold with changing weather graces the trails. Each step along this route reveals untouched flora, alpine meadows, and timeless folklore cherished by the local indigenous communities.

Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Rupin Pass trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Shimla to Jiskun", "description": "Day 1: Shimla to Jiskun (7,700 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 180 km in 8\u20139 hours via Rohru, Chirgaon and Dhaula to reach the quaint Himalayan village of Jiskun, the starting point of the trek. Enjoy scenic views of apple orchards, traditional wooden houses and the Rupin Valley before dinner and an overnight stay. Meals: Dinner | Stay: Camps/Homestay at Jiskun.**", "distance": "180 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Jiskun to Jakha", "description": "Day 2: Jiskun to Jakha (8,700 ft) \u2013 Trek around 10 km in 5\u20136 hours through terraced fields, dense forests and charming mountain villages. Cross suspension bridges and ascend gradually to reach Jakha, popularly known as the hanging village of Himachal Pradesh. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Camps at Jakha.**", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Jakha to Dhanderas Thatch", "description": "Day 3: Jakha to Dhanderas Thatch (11,700 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 11 km in 6\u20137 hours along the Rupin River, traversing through alpine meadows, waterfalls and pine forests. Reach the beautiful campsite of Dhanderas Thatch, surrounded by towering cliffs and snow-covered peaks. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Camps at Dhanderas Thatch.**", "distance": "11 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Dhanderas Thatch to Upper Waterfall Camp", "description": "Day 4: Dhanderas Thatch to Upper Waterfall Camp (13,100 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 6 km in 4\u20135 hours through glacial valleys, snow bridges and rugged terrain. Witness the famous three-tiered Rupin Waterfall before reaching the spectacular Upper Waterfall campsite. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Camps at Upper Waterfall Camp.**", "distance": "6 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Upper Waterfall Camp", "description": "Day 5: Upper Waterfall Camp \u2013 Rupin Pass \u2013 Ronti Gad (13,000 ft) \u2013 Trek approximately 12 km in 8\u20139 hours crossing the majestic Rupin Pass (15,350 ft), the highest point of the trek. Enjoy panoramic views of the Kinnaur and Garhwal Himalayas before descending through snowfields and alpine landscapes to Ronti Gad campsite. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Camps at Ronti Gad.**", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Ronti Gad to Sangla", "description": "Day 6: Ronti Gad to Sangla (8,900 ft) \u2013 Descend around 12 km in 5\u20136 hours through meadows, forests and shepherd trails to reach Sangla in the beautiful Baspa Valley. Spend the evening exploring the valley and relaxing after the challenging pass crossing. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Hotel/Camps at Sangla.**", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Sangla to Shimla", "description": "Day 7: Sangla to Shimla (7,220 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 220 km in 8\u20139 hours via Karcham, Rampur and Narkanda to reach Shimla. Check into the hotel and enjoy a comfortable overnight stay. Meals: Breakfast & Dinner | Stay: Shimla.**", "distance": "220 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Departure from Shimla", "description": "Day 8: Departure from Shimla \u2013 After breakfast, the journey concludes with wonderful memories of crossing one of the most scenic Himalayan passes, offering a perfect blend of forests, waterfalls, meadows and high-altitude landscapes. Meals: Breakfast.**", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Jubbarhatti Airport Shimla", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Dehradun Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Dehradun", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
        30.7333, 76.7794, '15380ft', '', '',
