        'Adventure', 'The Kanamo Peak Trek is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of KAZA, Himachal Pradesh. Rising to an impressive altitude of 19553ft over a duration of 6D/5N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

