h \u2013 After breakfast, check out from the hotel and depart with unforgettable memories of conquering Khardung La (18,380 ft) and Chang La (17,590 ft) while exploring the rugged beauty of Ladakh.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Kushok Bakula Rimpochee Airport, Leh", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Jammu Tawi Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Leh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
