r", "description": "Day 7: Tibb Cave to Tsomo Paldar (10,900 ft) \u2013 Trek 14 km in 6\u20137 hours over frozen sections of the river surrounded by dramatic Himalayan scenery. Reach Tsomo Paldar and spend the evening relaxing at camp.", "distance": "14 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Tsomo Paldar to Shingra Koma", "description": "Day 8: Tsomo Paldar to Shingra Koma \u2013 Drive to Leh (11,500 ft) \u2013 Trek 5 km in 2\u20133 hours back to Shingra Koma and drive to Leh. Celebrate the completion of this extraordinary winter expedition in Ladakh.", "distance": "5 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 9, "title": "Departure from Leh", "description": "Day 9: Departure from Leh \u2013 After breakfast, depart from Leh with unforgettable memories of walking on the frozen Zanskar River. The journey concludes with experiences of one of the world''s most unique winter treks.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Kushok Bakula Rimpoche Airport, Leh", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Jammu Tawi", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Leh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
