Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Kang Yatse- I stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.', 'The Kang Yatse- I is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of Leh, Ladakh. Rising to an impressive altitude of 21000 ft over a duration of 10D/9N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

Traversing through dense oak, pine, and vibrant rhododendron canopies, travelers experience panoramic vistas of snow-crowned Himalayan peaks, sparkling glacial river valleys, and remote mountain hamlets steeped in centuries-old traditions. The journey commences from Leh, taking explorers deep into untamed valleys where extremely cold weather with strong winds and snow at higher elevations. graces the trails. Each step along this route reveals untouched flora, alpine meadows, and timeless folklore cherished by the local indigenous communities.

Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Kang Yatse- I stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "Arrival in Leh", "description": "Day 1: Arrival in Leh (11,500 ft) \u2013 Arrive in Leh and spend the day acclimatizing to the high altitude. Evening briefing, equipment check and preparation for the expedition.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Acclimatization in Leh", "description": "Day 2: Acclimatization in Leh (11,500 ft) \u2013 Acclimatization hike and exploration around Leh including Shanti Stupa, Leh Palace and nearby monasteries to prepare the body for higher elevations.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Leh to Skiu", "description": "Day 3: Leh to Skiu (11,150 ft) \u2013 Drive to Chilling and trek about 8 km in 3\u20134 hours to Skiu village. Follow the Markha River through picturesque landscapes and traditional Ladakhi settlements.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Skiu to Markha", "description": "Day 4: Skiu to Markha (12,270 ft) \u2013 Trek 20 km in 7\u20138 hours through narrow valleys, river crossings and charming villages before reaching Markha, the largest village in the valley.", "distance": "20 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Markha to Thachungtse", "description": "Day 5: Markha to Thachungtse (14,300 ft) \u2013 Trek 13 km in 5\u20136 hours alongside the Markha River with magnificent views of Kang Yatse massif. Camp at Thachungtse amidst spectacular mountain scenery.", "distance": "13 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Thachungtse to Kang Yatse Base Camp", "description": "Day 6: Thachungtse to Kang Yatse Base Camp (16,700 ft) \u2013 Trek 5 km in 3\u20134 hours towards the base camp. Spend the afternoon resting, acclimatizing and practicing technical skills required for the summit attempt.", "distance": "5 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Acclimatization and Technical Training Day", "description": "Day 7: Acclimatization and Technical Training Day \u2013 Practice ascending and descending using fixed ropes, crampons, jumars and ice axes. Final preparations are made for the summit push.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Summit Kang Yatse I", "description": "Day 8: Summit Kang Yatse I (20,958 ft) and Return to Base Camp \u2013 Begin the summit attempt before midnight and climb through glacier terrain, steep snow slopes and technical sections. Reach the summit for panoramic views of the Karakoram, Zanskar and Ladakh ranges before descending back to Base Camp.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 9, "title": "Base Camp to Chokdo via Nimaling and Kongmaru La", "description": "Day 9: Base Camp to Chokdo via Nimaling and Kongmaru La (17,060 ft) \u2013 Descend via Nimaling and cross Kongmaru La Pass before reaching Chokdo. Drive back to Leh for the final overnight stay.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 10, "title": "Departure from Leh", "description": "Day 10: Departure from Leh \u2013 After breakfast, depart from Leh with unforgettable memories of summiting one of Ladakh''s most prestigious expedition peaks.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Kushok Bakula Rimpochee Airport, Leh", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: Jammu Tawi Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Leh", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
        30.7333, 76.7794, '21000 ft', '', '',
        '{"Ideal Season": "Apr-Jun, Sep-Nov | Temp: -5\u2103'' to 20\u2103'' | Weather: Extremely cold weather with strong winds and snow at higher elevations."}'::jsonb, 'Apr-Jun, Sep-Nov', '46 km', 'Leh', 'Leh',
        'Kushok Bakula Rimpochee Airport, Leh', 'Jammu Tawi Railway Station', 'Yes', '11000 ft', '21000 ft',
        '-5℃''', '20℃''', 'Extremely cold weather with strong winds and snow at higher elevations.', 'Ladakh', 'Leh',
        'TREK', 5.0
    ) RETURNING id INTO tid;
