Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Dzongri Trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "NJP/Bagdogra to Yuksom", "description": "Day 1: NJP/Bagdogra to Yuksom (5,840 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 150 km in 7\u20138 hours from NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport to Yuksom, the starting point of the trek. The scenic journey passes through lush valleys, winding mountain roads, and picturesque villages before reaching Yuksom. Spend the evening resting and preparing for the adventure ahead. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "150 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Yuksom to Tshoka", "description": "Day 2: Yuksom to Tshoka (9,700 ft) \u2013 Trek around 16 km in 7\u20138 hours through dense forests of oak, pine, and rhododendron. Cross several suspension bridges over the Prek Chu River and pass through Sachen and Bakhim before reaching the beautiful Tibetan settlement of Tshoka. Enjoy magnificent forest views and an immersive Himalayan experience. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Tshoka to Dzongri", "description": "Day 3: Tshoka to Dzongri (13,200 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 9 km in 6\u20137 hours while ascending through vibrant rhododendron forests, alpine terrain, and Deorali Top. As the tree line fades, stunning views of Kanchenjunga, Pandim, Kabru, and Rathong gradually emerge. Arrive at Dzongri by evening and camp amidst breathtaking mountain scenery. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Dzongri Exploration and Return to Tshoka", "description": "Day 4: Dzongri Exploration and Return to Tshoka \u2013 Begin early with a short 2 km hike to Dzongri Top (13,800 ft) to witness a spectacular sunrise over Kanchenjunga and the surrounding Himalayan giants. After spending time at the viewpoint, descend approximately 9 km in 5\u20136 hours back to Tshoka through alpine meadows and rhododendron forests. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Tshoka to Yuksom", "description": "Day 5: Tshoka to Yuksom (5,840 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 16 km in 6\u20137 hours, descending through Bakhim and Sachen while crossing suspension bridges and forest trails alongside the Prek Chu River. Reach Yuksom by evening and celebrate the successful completion of the trek. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Yuksom to NJP/Bagdogra", "description": "Day 6: Yuksom to NJP/Bagdogra \u2013 Drive approximately 150 km in 7\u20138 hours back to NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport. Enjoy the final glimpses of Sikkim''s valleys, forests, and mountain landscapes as the memorable Dzongri Trek concludes.", "distance": "150 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Bagdogra Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: New Jalpaiguri Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Yuksom", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
