        'Adventure', 'The Singalila Pass Trek is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of West Sikkim, Sikkim. Rising to an impressive altitude of 11900 ft over a duration of 8D/7N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

