Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Kasturi Orar Round Trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "NJP/Bagdogra to Yuksom", "description": "Day 1: NJP/Bagdogra to Yuksom (5,840 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 150 km in 7\u20138 hours from NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport to Yuksom, the historic gateway to West Sikkim treks. The journey passes through lush valleys, rivers, and winding mountain roads before reaching the charming Himalayan village. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "150 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Yuksom to Tshoka", "description": "Day 2: Yuksom to Tshoka (9,700 ft) \u2013 Trek around 16 km in 7\u20138 hours through dense forests of oak, pine, and rhododendron. Cross suspension bridges over the Prek Chu River and pass through Sachen and Bakhim before arriving at the picturesque Tibetan settlement of Tshoka. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Tshoka to Dzongri", "description": "Day 3: Tshoka to Dzongri (13,200 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 9 km in 6\u20137 hours while ascending through rhododendron forests and alpine terrain. Magnificent views of Kanchenjunga, Kabru, Pandim, and Rathong gradually unfold as you reach the expansive meadows of Dzongri. Overnight camping.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Dzongri to Kasturi Orar Base Camp", "description": "Day 4: Dzongri to Kasturi Orar Base Camp (14,100 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 8 km in 5\u20136 hours across high-altitude meadows and rocky terrain. The trail traverses remote alpine landscapes with exceptional views of snow-clad peaks before reaching the beautiful campsite beneath the Kasturi Orar ridge. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Kasturi Orar Base Camp to Kasturi Orar Pass", "description": "Day 5: Kasturi Orar Base Camp to Kasturi Orar Pass (15,300 ft) and Phedang (12,000 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 12 km in 7\u20138 hours while crossing the spectacular Kasturi Orar Pass. The route offers panoramic vistas of Kanchenjunga, Kabru, Rathong, and surrounding Himalayan ranges before descending to the scenic campsite at Phedang. Overnight camping.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Phedang to Tshoka", "description": "Day 6: Phedang to Tshoka (9,700 ft) \u2013 Trek around 8 km in 4\u20135 hours through rhododendron forests and alpine meadows. Descend gradually towards Tshoka while enjoying changing mountain landscapes and rich Himalayan flora. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Tshoka to Yuksom", "description": "Day 7: Tshoka to Yuksom (5,840 ft) \u2013 Descend approximately 16 km in 6\u20137 hours via Bakhim and Sachen, crossing suspension bridges and forest trails alongside the Prek Chu River before reaching Yuksom. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Buffer Day at Yuksom", "description": "Day 8: Buffer Day at Yuksom \u2013 This day is reserved for weather contingencies, acclimatization requirements, or delays during the crossing of Kasturi Orar Pass. Trekkers may also spend time exploring the cultural heritage and monasteries of Yuksom. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 9, "title": "Yuksom to NJP/Bagdogra", "description": "Day 9: Yuksom to NJP/Bagdogra \u2013 Drive nearly 150 km in 7\u20138 hours back to NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport, concluding the Kasturi Orar Round Trek with unforgettable memories of remote alpine terrain, pristine valleys, and spectacular Himalayan panoramas.", "distance": "150 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Bagdogra Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: New Jalpaiguri Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Yuksom", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
