Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Phoktey Dara trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.', 'The Phoktey Dara trek is one of the most breathtaking Himalayan journeys situated across the mesmerizing landscapes of West Sikkim, Sikkim. Rising to an impressive altitude of 12300 ft over a duration of 6D/5N, this expedition offers a transcendent blend of ancient cultural lore, sacred alpine sanctuaries, and pristine high-altitude wilderness.

Traversing through dense oak, pine, and vibrant rhododendron canopies, travelers experience panoramic vistas of snow-crowned Himalayan peaks, sparkling glacial river valleys, and remote mountain hamlets steeped in centuries-old traditions. The journey commences from Hilley, taking explorers deep into untamed valleys where pleasant weather with cool breeze and occasional mist. graces the trails. Each step along this route reveals untouched flora, alpine meadows, and timeless folklore cherished by the local indigenous communities.

Whether ascending dramatic ridge lines, camping beneath star-studded Himalayan skies, or immersing in the spiritual resonance of the high Himalayas, the Phoktey Dara trek stands as an unforgettable expedition of exploration, resilience, and natural majesty.',
        '[{"day": 1, "title": "NJP/Bagdogra to Uttarey", "description": "Day 1: NJP/Bagdogra to Uttarey (6,400 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 160 km in 7\u20138 hours from NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport to Uttarey, a beautiful village in West Sikkim that serves as the starting point of the trek. The journey passes through scenic valleys, forests, and traditional Himalayan settlements before reaching Uttarey. Overnight stay in a homestay or guesthouse.", "distance": "160 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Uttarey to Thangsing", "description": "Day 2: Uttarey to Thangsing (10,200 ft) \u2013 Trek around 12 km in 6\u20137 hours through dense forests of oak, magnolia, bamboo, and rhododendron. The trail ascends gradually along ridges and mountain paths, offering occasional views of the surrounding valleys before reaching the campsite at Thangsing. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Thangsing to Phoktey Dara", "description": "Day 3: Thangsing to Phoktey Dara (12,100 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 10 km in 5\u20136 hours while trekking through alpine meadows and rhododendron-covered slopes. As the trail gains altitude, spectacular views of the Kanchenjunga massif, Kabru, Pandim, and other Himalayan peaks emerge. Reach Phoktey Dara, one of the finest viewpoints in Sikkim, and enjoy panoramic mountain vistas. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Phoktey Dara to Sikkhey", "description": "Day 4: Phoktey Dara to Sikkhey (7,200 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 14 km in 6\u20137 hours while descending through forests, meadows, and remote Himalayan villages. The route provides stunning ridge walks and uninterrupted views of the snow-clad Eastern Himalayas before reaching the picturesque village of Sikkhey. Overnight stay in a homestay.", "distance": "14 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Sikkhey to Uttarey", "description": "Day 5: Sikkhey to Uttarey (6,400 ft) \u2013 Cover around 10 km in 4\u20135 hours through traditional villages, terraced fields, and forested trails. Arrive back at Uttarey by afternoon and spend the evening relaxing and exploring the local culture. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Uttarey to NJP/Bagdogra", "description": "Day 6: Uttarey to NJP/Bagdogra \u2013 Drive approximately 160 km in 7\u20138 hours back to NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport. Enjoy the final views of Sikkim''s valleys, forests, and mountain landscapes as the memorable Phoktey Dara Trek comes to an end.", "distance": "160 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Bagdogra Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: New Jalpaiguri Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Hilley", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
