        '[{"day": 1, "title": "NJP/Bagdogra to Lachen", "description": "Day 1: NJP/Bagdogra to Lachen (8,800 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 130 km in 7\u20138 hours from NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport to Lachen in North Sikkim. The journey passes through scenic valleys, waterfalls, and winding mountain roads before reaching the picturesque mountain village. Spend the evening acclimatizing and preparing for the trek. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "130 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Lachen to Tarum Tsachu", "description": "Day 2: Lachen to Tarum Tsachu (11,500 ft) \u2013 Trek around 12 km in 5\u20136 hours through dense forests of pine, fir, and rhododendron while following the course of mountain streams and alpine valleys. The trail gradually ascends towards Tarum Tsachu, a remote natural hot spring revered by local communities for its therapeutic properties. Overnight stay in tents near the hot springs.", "distance": "12 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Tarum Tsachu to Lhaba Tarum", "description": "Day 3: Tarum Tsachu to Lhaba Tarum (13,800 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 10 km in 5\u20136 hours through high-altitude meadows and rugged Himalayan terrain. As the trek gains elevation, magnificent views of surrounding snow-clad peaks and pristine valleys unfold before reaching the scenic campsite at Lhaba Tarum. Overnight camping.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Exploration and Acclimatization at Lhaba Tarum", "description": "Day 4: Exploration and Acclimatization at Lhaba Tarum (13,800 ft) \u2013 Spend the day acclimatizing and exploring the alpine surroundings. Enjoy panoramic views of North Sikkim''s mountains, glacial valleys, and untouched landscapes while allowing your body to adapt to the higher altitude. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Lhaba Tarum to Tarum Tsachu", "description": "Day 5: Lhaba Tarum to T