        '[{"day": 1, "title": "NJP/Bagdogra to Yuksom", "description": "Day 1: NJP/Bagdogra to Yuksom (5,840 ft) \u2013 Drive approximately 150 km in 7\u20138 hours from NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport to Yuksom, the historic gateway to West Sikkim. The scenic journey winds through river valleys, forests, and mountain roads before reaching the quaint Himalayan village. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "150 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 2, "title": "Yuksom to Tshoka", "description": "Day 2: Yuksom to Tshoka (9,700 ft) \u2013 Trek around 16 km in 7\u20138 hours through dense forests of oak, pine, magnolia, and rhododendron. Cross suspension bridges over the Prek Chu River and pass through Sachen and Bakhim before arriving at the beautiful Tibetan settlement of Tshoka. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 3, "title": "Tshoka to Dzongri", "description": "Day 3: Tshoka to Dzongri (13,200 ft) \u2013 Cover approximately 9 km in 6\u20137 hours while ascending through rhododendron forests and alpine terrain. As the vegetation thins, spectacular views of Kanchenjunga, Pandim, Kabru, and Rathong emerge. Reach Dzongri by evening and camp amidst breathtaking Himalayan scenery. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 4, "title": "Dzongri to Talung Valley Base Camp", "description": "Day 4: Dzongri to Talung Valley Base Camp (13,800 ft) \u2013 Trek nearly 10 km in 5\u20136 hours through remote alpine meadows, ridges, and glacial landscapes. The trail offers magnificent panoramas of surrounding peaks and leads into the pristine Talung Valley region. Overnight camping.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 5, "title": "Talung Valley Exploration", "description": "Day 5: Talung Valley Exploration (14,500 ft) \u2013 Spend the day exploring the upper reaches of Talung Valley, covering around 8 km in 4\u20135 hours. Traverse moraines, alpine grasslands, and glacial terrain while enjoying stunning views of Talung Glacier, Kabru massif, and neighboring Himalayan summits. Return to camp for an overnight stay.", "distance": "8 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 6, "title": "Talung Valley Base Camp to Dzongri", "description": "Day 6: Talung Valley Base Camp to Dzongri (13,200 ft) \u2013 Trek approximately 10 km in 5\u20136 hours while retracing the route through alpine meadows and high-altitude landscapes back to Dzongri. Enjoy changing perspectives of the mountains and valleys before reaching camp. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "10 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 7, "title": "Dzongri to Tshoka", "description": "Day 7: Dzongri to Tshoka (9,700 ft) \u2013 Descend around 9 km in 4\u20135 hours through rhododendron forests and mountain trails. Reach Tshoka by afternoon and spend the evening relaxing amidst the tranquil surroundings. Overnight stay in tents.", "distance": "9 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 8, "title": "Tshoka to Yuksom", "description": "Day 8: Tshoka to Yuksom (5,840 ft) \u2013 Cover nearly 16 km in 6\u20137 hours via Bakhim and Sachen, crossing suspension bridges and forest paths before returning to Yuksom. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "16 km", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 9, "title": "Buffer Day at Yuksom", "description": "Day 9: Buffer Day at Yuksom \u2013 This day is reserved for weather contingencies, acclimatization, or delays during the expedition. Trekkers can also explore Yuksom''s monasteries and cultural heritage sites while enjoying the peaceful Himalayan atmosphere. Overnight stay in a guesthouse.", "distance": "", "time": "", "image": ""}, {"day": 10, "title": "Yuksom to NJP/Bagdogra", "description": "Day 10: Yuksom to NJP/Bagdogra \u2013 Drive approximately 150 km in 7\u20138 hours back to NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport, concluding the Talung Valley Trek with unforgettable memories of remote valleys, glaciers, and spectacular Himalayan vistas.", "distance": "150 km", "time": "", "image": ""}]'::jsonb, '[{"location": "Airport: Bagdogra Airport", "price": 0}, {"location": "Railway: New Jalpaiguri Railway Station", "price": 0}, {"location": "Base: Yuksom", "price": 0}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
